<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Compact</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>change compact
</pre>
<p>Turns compact mode on or off. Normally the game leaves an empty line 
before your prompt; in compact mode it doesn't, so more fits on your 
screen. Type it again to go back. The setting is kept with your character.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Brief</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Change</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Prompt Colors</a>
</pre>




</div>